    "finding": "A larger false hole inside the glossy green/black paper truncates center-out scanlines. Eighty-four of 178 shared right-edge samples shift more than ten working pixels inward. The unchanged line-support gate rejects the crop, although the proposed square barely moves. Swapping only the mask, retaining the other fields, reproduces the opposite line evidence in both directions.",
